  <div class="brief-keep" style="max-width:820px;margin:26px auto 0">
    <h2 style="padding-top:0">Overview</h2>
    <p>GM Energy's first step into ecommerce — taking their home energy management system (HEMS) line from no digital presence to a launched, financed, installable commerce experience, and building the research practice that keeps improving it.</p>
