  <p>Checkout wasn't one flow — it was a matrix of business flows spanning hardware, installation, financing, and payment states, each mapped end to end with order management and partner systems.</p>
  <figure class="jmap"><img src="/assets/img/hems/checkout-business-flows.webp" alt="Ecomm 2.0 business flows — swimlane diagrams across payment and financing permutations" style="width:100%;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid var(--hair);display:block" loading="lazy" />
