    <figure><div class="shot lg-scroll lg-drift"><img src="/assets/img/hems/live-howitworks.webp" alt="How It Works page, live — full page auto-scrolling" loading="lazy"></div><figcaption>How It Works, live — scrolls itself; hover to take over.</figcaption></figure>
